<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1079334/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079335" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute>Illustrissimo atque Celeberrimo
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Jo:</abbr><expan>Johanni</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs> <choice><abbr>P.</abbr><expan>Petrus</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>A.</abbr><expan>Antonius</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelottus</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></salute></opener>
  <p>In hanc <rs key="place_GEO-2973783" type="place">Argentoratensium</rs> Urbem protinus ut veni Nobilissimus Vene<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>torum Legatus <rs key="pers_DE-588-121843858" type="person"><choice><abbr>Laur.</abbr><expan>Laurentius</expan></choice> Theupolus</rs> Eques, ac <choice><abbr>D.</abbr><expan>Divi</expan></choice> Marci <choice><abbr>Procu.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr><expan>Procurator</expan></choice> cubiti, dexter<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>manus, dextrique <choice><sic>genu</sic><corr>genus</corr></choice> dolore ita conflictari coepit, ut hanc vestram
      <lb/>inclytam accedendi Civitat<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>, Te potissimum, Vir Amicissime, salutandi
      <lb/>atque videndi causa, voluptate privari fuerim coactus. Quoniam
      <lb/>igitur fato, nescio quo, Te osculandi, Tibique meam erga Te gratitudi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nem coram testificandi occasio veluti mihi abripitur, quod orete<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nus pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stare nequeo per litteras efficere conabor, donec aliud
      <lb/>ad vos veniendi peropportun<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> tempus adveniat. Statim ac
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-121843858" type="person"><choice><abbr>Excellentiss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimus</expan></choice> Vir</rs> modo memoratus convalescet primum <rs key="place_GEO-2954172" type="place">Augustam
      <lb/>Vindelicor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>, inde <rs key="place_GEO-3165243" type="place">Trident<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>, postea <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetias</rs> maximis itineribus
      <lb/>contendemus, quo ubi pervenero tuas <rs key="B_991170515149205501" type="letter">litteras</rs> mihi pergratas
      <lb/>atque <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me diu optatas expectabo. Maximo me favore afficies,
      <lb/>Vir sapientissime, si aliquando cogitabis de ratione solvendi, diluen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dique <choice><abbr>Illustriss.</abbr><expan>Illustrissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person"><choice><abbr>Jacob.</abbr><expan>Jacobi</expan></choice> Riccati</rs> objectiones,<note type="comment" resp="SG"><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119543885">Jacopo Riccati</rs> erhob die Einwände in seiner Antwort auf Michelottis Schreiben vom 1. November 1721 (<rs type="biblio" key="biblio_EZ8DKI4W"><hi rend="i">Difesa del corollario II</hi></rs>, pp. 431–437). Michelotti hatte Auszüge aus der Antwort schon im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515149605501">Brief</rs> vom 23. Januar 1722 (pp. 1–7) in lateinischer Bearbeitung wiedergegeben.</note> seu difficultates, pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tereaque
      <lb/>ad me perscribes quid Tibi videatur de illusmodi objectionibus militantibus pro
      <lb/><rs key="biblio_6CP8LL78" type="biblio">corollario</rs> newtoniano pertinente ad vim,<note type="comment" resp="SG">Gemeint ist das zweite Korollar zu Proposition XXXVI, Problem VIII, in Buch II der <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_6CP8LL78"><hi rend="i">Principia</hi></rs> (1713, p. 307). Für die Kraft, die den Wasserausfluss erzeugt, setzt Newton das Gewicht einer Wassersäule mit der Ausflussöffnung als Grundfläche und doppelter Fallhöhe an. In der <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_MF4GV2BJ">Erstausgabe</rs> hatte er das Gewicht der unmittelbar über der Öffnung stehenden Wassersäule angesetzt (1687, Buch II, Proposition XXXVII, Problem IX, p. 330).</note> totum aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> per foramen
      <lb/>in fundo vasis factum exilientis mot<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, generant<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>. Etenim, aiebat
      <lb/>ipse <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatus</rs>, quoniam effectus dato tempore geniti sunt suis ad<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quatis
      <lb/>causis proportionales, et effectus dato tempore generatus, in <rs key="pers_DE-588-118587544" type="person">Newto<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ni</rs> casu, sit quantitas aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualis duplo column<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <choice><sic>acque<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></sic><corr>aque<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></corr></choice> pro
      <lb/>base foramen in fundo fact<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, pro altitudine ipsius vasis altitu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>din<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> habentis, consequens est, vim totum aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> effluentis motum
      <lb/>producentem <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qual<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> esse duplo, non simplici ponderi <choice><sic>acque<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></sic><corr>aque<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></corr></choice>
      <lb/>column<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> modo commemorat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>. Nostr<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> demonstration<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>, eam ni<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mirum qu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> mihi communicasti pro demonstrando vim, requi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sit<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> ad generand<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> tot<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> motum esse <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qual<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> simplici pon<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>deri dict<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <choice><sic>acque<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></sic><corr>aque<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></corr></choice> column<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, paralogismo laborare asseruit i<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dem <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatus</rs>; qui concedit quid<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> antequam foramen in fundo vasis
      <lb/>fiat, ipsum foramen sustinere, ideoque premi <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> simplici pon<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dere column<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <choice><sic>acque<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></sic><corr>aque<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></corr></choice> s<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>p<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> memorat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> vasis foramini ad perpen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>diculum insistentis; at ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> negat fact<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> jam apertura in ipso
<pb facs="1079336" n="2"/>
      <lb/>vasis fundo, vim generantem aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> motum totam, quanta est, attribuen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dam esse simplici <choice><sic>acque<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></sic><corr>aque<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></corr></choice> column<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> foramini insistentis pon<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>deri. Ego puto responderi posse, agi in casu nostro de vi ge<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nerante primum aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> exilientis mot<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> tempusculo indefini<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>te parvo, non aut<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> de vi, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> requiritur ad efficiend<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ut certo
      <lb/>tempore finito exiliat certa aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> quantitas definita. Ver<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>ambigo an huiusmodi responsio sufficiat ad <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatian<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice></rs> diffi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cultat<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> tollend<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>. Putat demum (secus ac Tu, Vir Doctissime exis<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>timas) comparari posse vim acceleratricem cum vi gravitatis, in<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>deque null<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> nasci absurditat<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> sibi persuadet, propterea quod ejusmodi compara<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tiones non sunt nisi relationes qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>dam. H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c Tibi, et fortasse cum
      <lb/>tedio repeto, verens ne forte [non?] servaris longissim<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> me<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs key="B_991170515149605501" type="letter">epistolam</rs>,
      <lb/>quam jam pridem, nimirum Januario jam pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>terito raptim ad
      <lb/>Te scriptitavi, et ad qu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> nunqu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> adversa pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>peditus valetudine
      <lb/>respondere valuisti. Si possum Te etiam atque etiam orare, Vir
      <lb/>Ingeniosissime, Te qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>so, et obsecro, ut <rs type="letter">epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice></rs> ad me scribas om<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nia, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> dici possunt de s<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>pius commemorato <rs key="biblio_6CP8LL78" type="biblio">corollario</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118587544" type="person">Newtonia<unclear>n</unclear>o</rs>
      <lb/>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tereaque de <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatianis</rs> objectionibus complectentem.<note type="comment" resp="SG">Im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515148705501">Brief</rs> vom 14. November 1722 (p. 2) stellte Johann I Bernoulli eine Stellungnahme zu Riccatis Einwänden für die Zeit nach Michelottis Rückkehr nach Venedig in Aussicht. Michelotti bat im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515108605501">Brief</rs> vom 2. Januar 1723 (pp. 2–3) erneut um eine ausführliche Antwort.</note> Hoc si
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> Te impetraro, me Tibi pluribus de nominibus jam obstrictum,
      <lb/>quammaxime devinct<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> putabo. Hac in <rs key="place_GEO-2973783" type="place">Urbe</rs> permanebo (nam
      <lb/>Amplissimus Legatus <rs key="pers_DE-588-121843858" type="person">Theupolus</rs> hodi<choice><orig><g ref="#eacut">é</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> maxime torquetur manus,
      <lb/>ac genu dolore, qui ad alias articulationes fortasse tendet)
      <lb/>ad minus dies octo, ac propterea tempus, quemadmod<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> mihi
      <lb/>persuadeo Tibi supererit ad me perscribendi de rebus, de
      <lb/>quibus modo dicebam. Sed si tempus sit nimis angustum,
      <lb/>maius temporis spatium Tibi concedo; sufficiet videlicet
      <lb/>si <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetias</rs> per <rs key="place_GEO-2775220" type="place">Oenipont<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> ad me Litteras transmittas
      <lb/>die vigesima mensis proximi Decembris. Nam spero esse <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Ve<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>netiis</rs> sub fin<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> Decembris nisi <choice><abbr>Excell.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-121843858" type="person">Theupoli</rs> <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>gritudo
      <lb/>me cogat h<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>c longo morari tempore, qua de re maximopere
      <lb/>dubito. Interim aliquod ad hanc meam epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs key="B_991170515148705501" type="letter">respons<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>
<pb facs="1079337" n="3"/>
      <lb/>hac in <rs key="place_GEO-2973783" type="place">Civitate</rs> expectabo. Cupio enim scire num bene
      <lb/>valeas simul cum ingeniosissimis <rs key="pers_DE-588-118656503 pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filiis</rs> tuis, quibus salut<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> plu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rimam dico. Sed transeamus ad alia. Clarissimus <rs key="pers_DE-588-117625493" type="person">Sherard</rs> Bota<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nices Professor anglicus longe eruditissimus, meique amicissimus
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-2643743" type="place">Londino</rs> <rs key="place_GEO-2988507" type="place">Parisios</rs> s<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>pe ad me scripsit, meque certiorem fecit, me<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">de Separatione Fluidor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> opus una cum Tuis ingeniosis <rs key="biblio_JAFFCHKU" type="biblio">De Motu Mus<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>culor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>, et <rs key="biblio_W6BHQDM2" type="biblio"><choice><orig>de</orig><reg>De</reg></choice> <choice><abbr>eff.<hi rend="sup">a</hi></abbr><expan>effervescentia</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Ferme.<hi rend="sup">ne</hi></abbr><expan>Fermentatione</expan></choice></rs> Dissertationibus felicissime Londini vendi, quin imo
      <lb/>Illustrissimi <rs key="pers_DE-588-118587544" type="person">Newtoni</rs>, <choice><abbr>Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>clariss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>clarissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119507978" type="person">Jurini</rs>, et <choice><abbr>Experientiss.</abbr><expan>Experientissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-117559822" type="person">Mead</rs> no<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mine mihi egit gratias pro munusculo dicti mei Operis, quod me
      <lb/>rogante illis obtulit ille ipse <choice><abbr>Clariss.</abbr><expan>Clarissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-117625493" type="person">Sherard</rs>, qui etiam me admo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nuit modo laudat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-117559822" type="person">Mead</rs> <choice><abbr>Med.<hi rend="sup">n<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></hi></abbr><expan>Medicin<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></expan></choice> Professor<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <rs type="biblio">Tractat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> propedi<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> editur<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>fore de Motu Musculor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, et peculiari quid<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> methodo conscript<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>. Celeberri<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mus, nostrique amantissimus <rs key="pers_DE-588-119062372" type="person">Varignonus</rs> bene valet, Tibique
      <lb/>salut<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> plurim<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> dicit. Tria <rs key="biblio_4TGZFAHD" type="biblio">Optices</rs> gallica lingua
      <lb/>conscript<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> exemplaria ad Te transmittenda nisi defe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>renda, mihi tradidit Luteti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <rs key="place_GEO-2988507" type="place">Parisiorum</rs> una cum <rs type="biblio">exempla<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ri</rs><note type="comment" resp="SG">Gemeint ist der 1722 in Paris erschienene Jahrgang 1720 der <hi rend="i">Histoire de l’Académie royale des sciences</hi> mit den <hi rend="i">Mémoires de mathématique et de physique</hi>. <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119062372">Pierre Varignon</rs> bezeichnet das für Bernoulli bestimmte Exemplar im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170516663905501">Brief</rs> vom 30. Oktober 1722 (p. 3) als «un Rouleau des Mem. de 1720».</note> <choice><abbr>Commentar.</abbr><expan>Commentariorum</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Reg.</abbr><expan>Regiae</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Academ.</abbr><expan>Academiae</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Scient.</abbr><expan>Scientiarum</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Paris.</abbr><expan>Parisinae</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>an.</abbr><expan>anni</expan></choice> 1720. H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c omni
      <lb/>in <rs type="biblio">fascicul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> collecta sperab<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>, avebamque ad Te deferre:
      <lb/>Verumenimvero id pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stare prohibitus maximo cum
      <lb/>meo dolore, ill<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ips<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <rs type="biblio">fascicul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> alia ratione ad Te defe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rend<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> curo. Honoratissimus Mercator <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1382436645"><hi rend="u">Jonas Frederique
      <lb/>Fetticq</hi></rs> Argentoratensis promittit mihi, hac hebdomada
      <lb/>mercium quarundam suar<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ope, ad Te mittere modo dic<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tum librorum fascicul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice><note type="comment" resp="SG">Das Bücherpaket enthielt drei Exemplare der französischen <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_4TGZFAHD"><hi rend="i">Optique</hi></rs> und ein Exemplar der Pariser Akademiememoiren für 1720. Im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515108705501">Brief</rs> vom 18. November 1722 (p. 2) berichtet Michelotti, dass die Bücher und das Etui mit den mathematischen Instrumenten zusammen mit Handelswaren verschickt worden waren.</note>. Cui fasciculo addidi instrumenta
      <lb/>omnia, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> petiisti mathematica cavo cuidam inclusa, ut
      <lb/>moris est. H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c vero instrumenta mathematica <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <choice><abbr>Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stantiss.</abbr><expan>Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stantissimo</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119062372" type="person">Va<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rignono</rs> <rs key="place_GEO-2988507" type="place">Parisiis</rs> visa, selecta, probataque Tibi, Vir <choice><abbr>Amiciss:<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr><expan>Amicissime</expan></choice> dono da<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>re audeo tanqu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> grat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> erga Te voluntatis testimoni<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> aliquod. Mul<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tos sumptus in mittendis, et accipiendis meis litteris pluries fecisti; Tibi
      <lb/>mult<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> debeo, multumque debere volo; Si <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs>, aut h<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>c aliquid efficere
      <lb/>possum, impera, omnia enim qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> jubebis libentissime efficiam. A Te autem
      <lb/>nihil aliud peto qu<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>m ut me amare pergas, ut ad meas epistolas, et quas Tibi pro<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ponam qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stiones, saltem quolibet tertio mense, respondere ne graveris. Quod
      <lb/>ad sumptus pertinet, ego omnes sumptus persolv<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>, seu argent<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <fw type="catch" place="inline">Tibi redd<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice></fw>
      <lb/><metamark/>
<pb facs="1079339" n="5"/>
      <lb/><metamark/>Tibi redd<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>, quod erogabis in accipiendis
      <lb/>aut mittendis pro litteris. Ego enim de
      <lb/>huiusmodi sumptibus haudquaq<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> curo,
      <lb/>proptereaquod maioris puto tuas doctri<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nas, et tuas ratiocinationes, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> ipsum
      <lb/>argent<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> et aurum. Tempore quo absolvo
      <lb/>hujusmodi me<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs key="B_991170515148905501" type="letter">epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice></rs> bene long<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> pro<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>video morbum articular<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <choice><abbr>Nobiliss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Nobilissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-121843858" type="person">L. Theupo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>li</rs> quindecim salt<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> dies duratur<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>. Quare
      <lb/>Tibi tempus superest (si tamen bene va<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>leas) ad meas hasce litteras responden<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>di. Poteris aut<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <choice><sic>mittera</sic><corr>mittere</corr></choice> epistolas<note type="comment" resp="SG">Johann I Bernoulli berichtet im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515148705501">Brief</rs> vom 14. November 1722 (p. 1), er habe bereits ein Schreiben mit einem beigelegten Brief seines ältesten Sohnes <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-117589144">Nicolaus II Bernoulli</rs> an <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-128382058">Johann Salzmann</rs> in Strassburg adressiert. Michelotti wartete in Strassburg noch auf die Sendung, wie er im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515108705501">Brief</rs> vom 18. November 1722 (p. 2) mitteilte. Salzmann hatte sie ihm nach Paris weitergeleitet.</note> sub
      <lb/>meo nomine addendo qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sequuntur
      <lb/>verba. "Chez Monsieur <rs key="pers_DE-588-128382058" type="person">Saltzman</rs>
      <lb/>Professeur tres celebre d’Anatomie
      <lb/>à <rs key="place_GEO-2973783" type="place">Strasbourg</rs>." Aveo videre pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stantissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>m<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> Fili<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> tu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118656503" type="person">Daniel<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice></rs>, quem uti et
      <lb/>peringenios<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ejus Fratr<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Nicola<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> una<supplied> cum</supplied>
      <lb/>Illustrissimo <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnato Tuo</rs> Logic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Professore
      <lb/>ex corde saluto.</p> <closer><salute>Vale, Vir Celeberrime.</salute>
